OL,3,APoundland supplier 'will lose millions'
OL,4,Aif retailer collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major Poundland supplier has warned
OL,7,Fit will lose millions of pounds while
OL,8,Fsmaller companies supplying the
OL,9,Fretailer will go bust if it collapses,
OL,10,Frisking thousands of jobs.
OL,12,FAdam Turner, sales director at
OL,13,FBradford-based Highcrest Retail Brands,
OL,14,Fsaid Poundland was one of its biggest
OL,15,Fcustomers and its collapse would cost
OL,16,Fit "a few million" in lost sales.
OL,18,FPoundland's owners, US-based investment
OL,19,Ffirm Gordon Brothers, is facing
OL,20,Fgovernment scrutiny after refusing a
OL,21,Fbid which would have kept the retailer
OL,22,Fin business.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
